    {
      "id": 52879,
      "name": "arenson9",
      "username": "arenson9",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-02-05T13:44:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ketigid\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ketigid:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Kickstarter soon?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'd think so. If they want to showcase the new game at GenCon and they want to give as much lead time for printing and receiving the game as they did to Shattered Timelines, they'll have to be done with the Kickstarter by the end of March, I'd think.</p>\n<p>I have no insider knowledge on this – pure speculation.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:26:54.640Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 7162,
      "topic_slug": "new-site",
      "display_username": "arenson9",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"ketigid\"]\n\nKickstarter soon?\n\n[/quote]\n\nI&#39;d think so. If they want to showcase the new game at GenCon and they want to give as much lead time for printing and receiving the game as they did to Shattered Timelines, they&#39;ll have to be done with the Kickstarter by the end of March, I&#39;d think.\n\nI have no insider knowledge on this -- pure speculation.\n",
