      "created_at": "2013-02-06T03:48:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Having no experience with game development or playtesting, what would one guess for a reasonable amount of time it takes for a game to go from alpha testing to be \"complete\" in the sense that it is ready to go to print? &nbsp;Not that I need more &gt;G goodness right now as I eagerly await the Ammo Drop of Shattered Timelines and several expansions on my doorstep in March, but I was curious when to expect to drop some more coin on &gt;G?</p>",
